OL,3,GNEWSATortured man's death in high-rise
OL,4,Aflat plunge could have been avoided -
OL,5,Ainquiry
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe death of a man who plunged from a
OL,8,Fhigh-rise flat - after the possible
OL,9,Flocation of screams for help were
OL,10,Fwrongly recorded in a 999 call - could
OL,11,Fhave been prevented, a sheriff has
OL,12,Fruled.
OL,14,FJamie Forbes, 37, was held against his
OL,15,Fwill and tortured in Elphinstone Court,
OL,16,Fan 18-storey building in Aberdeen, for
OL,17,Ftwo days in January 2024.
OL,19,FWhen police carried out door-to-door
OL,20,Finquiries they were unable to trace
OL,21,Fwhere the cries had come from. Forbes
OL,22,Fthen fell from a 12th floor window.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
