OL,3,GNEWSATortured man's death in high-rise
OL,4,Aflat plunge could have been avoided -
OL,5,Ainquiry
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice Scotland said they noted the
OL,8,Frecommendations, and work was ongoing
OL,9,Fto review and enhance processes
OL,10,Frelating to concern for person calls.
